#: source/command-ref/nix-env.md:7
msgid ""
"`nix-env` _operation_ \\[_options_\\] \\[_arguments…_\\] \\[`--option` "
"_name_ _value_\\] \\[`--arg` _name_ _value_\\] \\[`--argstr` _name_ "
"_value_\\] \\[{`--file` | `-f`} _path_\\] \\[{`--profile` | `-p`} _path_\\] "
