#: source/command-ref/nix-env.md:72
msgid "`nix-env` parses the symbolic derivation name `apache-httpd-2.0.48` as:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-env.md:76 source/command-ref/nix-env.md:87
msgid "\"name\""
